' U3 · Peta pengguna dan hak akses (draft 0.7, 27 Oktober 2026, sumber brief v1.15)
' Rincian dan matriks hak ada di U3-peta-pengguna.md (R-SEC-10, D-66). Nama orang tidak dicantumkan.
' Render dari folder docs/uml:
'   java -jar plantuml-1.2026.9.jar -tsvg -o export U3-peta-pengguna.puml

@startuml U3-H-peta-pengguna
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam PackageBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam PackageFontStyle bold
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

title U3-H · Peta pengguna dan hak akses (baseline, disetujui pemilik 27 Oktober 2026)\n(draft 0.7, sumber brief v1.15)

package "Jabatan" {
  package "Departemen NPI" {
    rectangle "PPAP Engineer" as jPPE
    rectangle "PPAP Staff" as jPPS
    rectangle "Project Leader\n(level Supervisor,\nper Project Group)" as jPL
    rectangle "APQP/PPAP Controller\n(PPAP Supervisor)" as jAPC
    rectangle "Project Engineer\n(level Leader,\nper Project Group)" as jPEng
  }
  package "Approver (tetap tanda tangan di kertas)" {
    rectangle "NPI Manager, QA QC Manager,\nAdvisor (slot GM), Factory Manager" as jApp
  }
  package "Departemen lain dan tim WI" {
    rectangle "QA, QC,\ninternal audit" as jQA
    rectangle "DCC" as jDCC
    rectangle "Tim WI dan\nECN & SAP Coordinator" as jWI
  }
  rectangle "Akun admin terpisah\n(akun kedua milik PPAP Staff)" as jAdmAcc
}

package "Peran di sistem" {
  package "Buat / Edit" #FFF1D6 {
    rectangle "Penyusun\nE-1 sampai E-5" as rPen
    rectangle "Pengelola template\nE-6" as rTpl
    rectangle "Dokumen kontrol\nE-7 sampai E-9" as rDok
    rectangle "Petugas migrasi\nE-10" as rMig
  }
  package "Verifikasi" #DCEAF7 {
    rectangle "Verifikator\nV-1" as rVer
    rectangle "Pemeriksa PFMEA–CP\nV-2" as rCek
  }
  package "Lihat" #E3F1E3 {
    rectangle "Viewer\nL-1 sampai L-3" as rView
  }
  package "Admin" #EEE3F5 {
    rectangle "Admin\nA-1 sampai A-4" as rAdm
  }
}

jPPE -[#C0392B,thickness=2]-> rPen
jPPE -[#C0392B,thickness=2]-> rTpl
jPPE -[#C0392B,thickness=2]-> rCek
jPPE -[#C0392B,thickness=2]-> rDok
jPPE -[#C0392B,thickness=2]-> rMig
jPPS -[#D68910,thickness=2]-> rPen
jPPS -[#D68910,thickness=2]-> rDok
jPPS -[#D68910,thickness=2]-> rMig
jAdmAcc -[#D68910,thickness=2]-> rAdm
jPL -[#1F618D,thickness=2]-> rPen
jPL -[#1F618D,thickness=2]-> rVer
jAPC -[#117A65,thickness=2]-> rVer
jPEng -[#7D3C98,thickness=2]-> rPen
jPEng -[#7D3C98,thickness=2]-> rVer
jApp -[#555555,thickness=2]-> rView
jWI -[#555555,thickness=2]-> rView
jQA -[#555555,thickness=2]-> rView
jDCC -[#555555,thickness=2]-> rView
jDCC .[#555555,thickness=2].> rDok

legend right
  Garis penuh: peran awal saat ini. Warna garis mengikuti jabatan asalnya.
  Garis putus-putus DCC ke Dokumen kontrol: nanti, bila admin
  memberi peran itu (D-60, D-66).
  Akun admin terpisah dari akun kerja PPAP Staff dan ditautkan
  ke pemegangnya (D-72, D-74, R-SEC-13).
  Project Leader dan Project Engineer: hanya customer di
  Project Group sendiri (D-71). Project Leader GR3 merangkap
  APQP/PPAP Controller.
  Pencatat rilis selalu berbeda dari penyusun: PPAP Staff
  dan PPAP Engineer saling mencatat (D-68).
  Semua pengguna yang login punya hak dasar Lihat.
  Admin bisa menambah peran atau mengubah isi peran;
  aturan R-SEC-11 tidak bisa diubah.
endlegend
@enduml
